========================================================================
POST-RACE UPDATE WORKFLOW (2026 SEASON)
========================================================================

STEP 1: UPDATE LOCAL JSON FILES
-------------------------------
Update these files in your local "F1-Telemetry" folder:
- F1:   src/config/f1/results.json, qualifying.json & sprint.json
- F2:   src/config/f2/results.json
- F1A:  src/config/f1a/results.json

*Note: Remember to add Sprint points directly to the 'points' field in results.json!

STEP 2: REBUILD & EXPORT DATA
-----------------------------
1. Run Rebuild: Visit http://localhost:3000/api/admin/rebuild-2026
2. Run Export Script: In terminal, run: 
   node scratch/export_for_github.js
   
This creates a folder: "export_to_github" containing the new stats.

STEP 3: UPLOAD TO GITHUB
------------------------
1. F1-Telemetry Repo: Push your edited config files.
2. f1nsight-api-2 Repo: Upload files from "export_to_github" folder:
   - drivers/*.json         -> GitHub drivers/
   - constructors/2026/*.json -> GitHub constructors/2026/
3. f1aapi Repo: Upload results.json (and drivers.json if needed).
4. f2api Repo: Upload results.json (and drivers.json if needed).

STEP 4: CLEAR LIVE CACHE
------------------------
Visit the live site with ?admin=true and click the "Refresh Data" button:
https://f1-telemetry.matthews-world.co.uk/teammates-comparison?admin=true
http://localhost:3006/teammates-comparison?admin=true

Individual Force-Refresh Links:
- F1A Results: https://f1-telemetry.matthews-world.co.uk/api.php?source=f1a&path=races/2026/results.json&refresh=true
- F1A Drivers: https://f1-telemetry.matthews-world.co.uk/api.php?source=f1a&path=constructors/2026/drivers.json&refresh=true
- F2 Results:  https://f1-telemetry.matthews-world.co.uk/api.php?source=f2&path=races/2026/results.json&refresh=true
- F1 Drivers:  https://f1-telemetry.matthews-world.co.uk/api.php?source=f1&path=drivers/antonelli.json&refresh=true
